{"id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-eight-tuple-dtm.md","title":"Deterministic Single-Tape Turing Machine","display":"df-deterministic-turing-machine — Deterministic Single-Tape Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","aliases":["73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","73-df-deterministic-turing-machine"],"display":"df-deterministic-turing-machine — Deterministic Single-Tape Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</span><span>73-df-deterministic-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-turing-machine — Deterministic Single-Tape Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (input alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\)</span> (distinct head-direction tokens)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (candidate eight-tuple)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blank}\">\\(\\mathrm{blank}\\)</span> 是下述存在量化的八元组空白字符分量，其类型约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transition is total exactly on nonhalting states, and the blank symbol is a tape symbol but not an input symbol.</li>\n<li>Machine collections are used as metatheoretic classes of set-coded tuples; no quantifier treats a proper class as a set-valued function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (input alphabet, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blank}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1905,"backlinks":[{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{blank}$ 是机器八元组中的空白字符分量，见 [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]；在下述存在量词内取被量化机器的对应分量。"},{"id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}$ (single-tape DTM, see [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]])"},{"id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sqcup$ 是本接口固定的空白字符，$\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma$；$L=\\mathsf L$、$R=\\mathsf R$ 是 [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]] 的两个方向。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}